---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: h.log
---
@1000 conn#1 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#1: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#1 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#1: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#1 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#1 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#1 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970"
@1000 conn#1 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #1: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970
@1000 sign-in #1 checked: https://id.example bob
   -> store #2: identity login example https://id.example bob
@1000 store answers #2: login ok, account 1 None
   -> event: conn#1: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#1 SignedIn example:bob 8c79… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#1 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#1: closed: the client left
@1000 conn#2 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#2: accepted on game
@1000 conn#2 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#2: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#2 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#2 sends TicketLogin example:bob 8c79… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#2: account 1 joined the game server
   -> store #3: load characters of 1
@1000 store answers #3: characters []
   -> send conn#2 Empire 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 1
   -> send conn#2 CharacterList []
@1000 conn#2 sends CreateCharacter slot=0 Bob class=0 empire=1
   -> store #4: create Bob for 1 in slot 0 at (475000, 966100) empire 1
@1000 store answers #4: created #1 Bob in slot 0
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 created
   -> send conn#2 CharacterCreated slot=0 #1 Bob class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
@1000 conn#2 sends SelectCharacter 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 2
   -> send conn#2 MainCharacter vid=1 Bob class=0 (475000, 966100) empire=1 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#2 Points 1=1 4=300 5=796 6=796 7=304 8=304 12=6 13=4 14=3 15=3 16=4 17=100 18=14 19=150 20=4 27=1
@1000 conn#2 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#2 Phase 3
   -> send conn#2 GameTime 1000
   -> send conn#2 Channel 1
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=1 (475000, 966100) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=1 Bob empire=1 level=1
   -> send conn#2 Skills
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 entered as vid 1
-- Alice makes two characters and plays the first, next to Bob
@1000 conn#3 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#3: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#3 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#3: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#3 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#3 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#3 SignInOptions [example] nonce="03d78a3f20d154abd8ddfa6974eedf6b"
@1000 conn#3 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #5: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=03d78a3f20d154abd8ddfa6974eedf6b
@1000 sign-in #5 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #6: identity login example https://id.example alice
@1000 store answers #6: login ok, account 2 None
   -> event: conn#3: account 2 signed in with example
   -> send conn#3 SignedIn example:alice 3784… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#3 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#3: closed: the client left
@1000 conn#4 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#4: accepted on game
@1000 conn#4 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#4: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#4 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#4 sends TicketLogin example:alice 3784… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#4: account 2 joined the game server
   -> store #7: load characters of 2
@1000 store answers #7: characters []
   -> send conn#4 Empire 0
   -> send conn#4 Phase 1
   -> send conn#4 CharacterList []
@1000 conn#4 sends CreateCharacter slot=0 Alice class=0 empire=1
   -> store #8: create Alice for 2 in slot 0 at (475000, 966100) empire 1
@1000 store answers #8: created #2 Alice in slot 0
   -> event: conn#4: character 2 created
   -> send conn#4 CharacterCreated slot=0 #2 Alice class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
@1000 conn#4 sends CreateCharacter slot=1 Ally class=3 empire=1
   -> store #9: create Ally for 2 in slot 1 at (475000, 966100) empire 1
@1000 store answers #9: created #3 Ally in slot 1
   -> event: conn#4: character 3 created
   -> send conn#4 CharacterCreated slot=1 #3 Ally class=3 st=3 ht=4 dx=3 iq=6
@1000 conn#4 sends SelectCharacter 0
   -> send conn#4 Phase 2
   -> send conn#4 MainCharacter vid=2 Alice class=0 (475000, 966100) empire=1 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#4 Points 1=1 4=300 5=796 6=796 7=304 8=304 12=6 13=4 14=3 15=3 16=4 17=100 18=14 19=150 20=4 27=1
@1000 conn#4 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#4 Phase 3
   -> send conn#4 GameTime 1000
   -> send conn#4 Channel 1
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=2 (475000, 966100) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityInfo vid=2 Alice empire=1 level=1
   -> send conn#4 Skills
   -> event: conn#4: character 2 entered as vid 2
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=2 (475000, 966100) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=2 Alice empire=1 level=1
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=1 (475000, 966100) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityInfo vid=1 Bob empire=1 level=1
@1000 conn#4 sends CharacterMove kind=1 (476000, 966100)
   -> send conn#2 EntityMove kind=1 vid=2 (476000, 966100) duration=1466
@3000 conn#4 sends CharacterMove kind=0 (476000, 966100)
   -> send conn#2 EntityMove kind=0 vid=2 (476000, 966100) duration=0
-- she leaves the game: Bob sees her go at once; the list waits for her save
@3000 conn#4 sends LeaveGame
   -> store #10: save #2 at (476000, 966100) played 2s
   -> send conn#2 EntityRemove vid=2
   -> event: conn#4: character 2 left for the character list
-- the save lands: the empire, the select phase and the list come again
@3000 store answers #10: saved: Ok(())
   -> store #11: load characters of 2
@3000 store answers #11: characters [0:Alice, 1:Ally]
   -> send conn#4 Empire 1
   -> send conn#4 Phase 1
   -> send conn#4 CharacterList [0: #2 Alice lv1, 1: #3 Ally lv1]
-- she plays her second character: Bob sees Ally come
@3000 conn#4 sends SelectCharacter 1
   -> send conn#4 Phase 2
   -> send conn#4 MainCharacter vid=3 Ally class=3 (475000, 966100) empire=1 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#4 Points 1=1 4=300 5=896 6=896 7=364 8=364 12=3 13=4 14=3 15=6 16=4 17=100 18=8 19=150 20=4 27=1
@3000 conn#4 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#4 Phase 3
   -> send conn#4 GameTime 3000
   -> send conn#4 Channel 1
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=3 (475000, 966100) race=3 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityInfo vid=3 Ally empire=1 level=1
   -> send conn#4 Skills
   -> event: conn#4: character 3 entered as vid 3
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=3 (475000, 966100) race=3 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=3 Ally empire=1 level=1
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=1 (475000, 966100) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityInfo vid=1 Bob empire=1 level=1
@3000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "hi Ally"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=0 vid=1 "Bob: hi Ally"
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=0 vid=1 "Bob: hi Ally"
-- Ally leaves too; leaving again at the character list is out of turn and closes
@3000 conn#4 sends LeaveGame
   -> store #12: save #3 at (475000, 966100) played 0s
   -> send conn#2 EntityRemove vid=3
   -> event: conn#4: character 3 left for the character list
@3000 store answers #12: saved: Ok(())
   -> store #13: load characters of 2
@3000 store answers #13: characters [0:Alice, 1:Ally]
   -> send conn#4 Empire 1
   -> send conn#4 Phase 1
   -> send conn#4 CharacterList [0: #2 Alice lv1, 1: #3 Ally lv1]
@3000 conn#4 sends LeaveGame
   -> close conn#4
   -> event: conn#4: closed: leaving the game out of turn
@3000 conn#2 closed: the client left
   -> store #14: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 2s
   -> event: conn#2: closed: the client left
@3000 store answers #14: saved: Ok(())
